					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><em>I've been bright, I've been faded<br /> I'm nearly halfway through<br /> Barely believe we made it<br /> When I met eyes with you<br /> I caught a walking fever<br /> I know how all this ends<br /> Palm over my receiver<br /> Cradling me again</em></p> <p><strong>-Fleet Foxes, <em>Cradling Mother, Cradling Woman</em></strong></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>This piece is dedicated to all those siblings we lost in 2020 to the global machine of transphobia. You deserved better.</p> <p>And also to PR, for persisting despite the flames.</p> <p>Thanks to those who helped during the critting process, including <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467264" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" >cybersqyd</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467264" alt="PeppersGhost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" >PeppersGhost</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467264" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/warfang" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2112729&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467264" alt="WarFang" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2112729)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/warfang" >WarFang</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6104981&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609467264" alt="OCuin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6104981)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" >OCuin</a></span>, and others.</p> <p>Happy New Year.</p> 
